          "settings": {
            "question": "Skincare specialists:",
            "answer": "<p>The Vapoderm Digipro is purpose-built to elevate the capabilities of skincare specialists during intensive facial treatments. By delivering a continuous, high-volume flow of advanced ionized steam, the unit actively softens cellular blockages within the stratum corneum. This thermal relaxation enables the practitioner to perform manual extractions with minimal tissue trauma, minimizing post-treatment erythema and significantly improving operational efficiency during deep-pore cleansing workflows.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical spa therapists:",
            "answer": "<p>For Clinical spa therapists executing multi-modality anti-aging regimens, the customizable three-level steam output serves as a crucial primer. Modulating the vapor intensity safely elevates skin temperature and microcirculation, dramatically boosting the transdermal absorption of specialized anti-aging, hydrating, and purifying topicals applied downstream. This targeted preparation allows clinical products to penetrate deeper and perform more effectively.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Aromatherapists and wellness clinicians:",
            "answer": "<p>Aromatherapists and wellness clinicians can seamlessly customize client experiences utilizing the integrated essential oil distribution system. By marrying pure therapeutic thermal vapor with targeted botanical infusions, practitioners can transition standard facials into premium, holistic sensory treatments. The precise controls ensure safe, aromatic dispersion that expands menu offerings and heightens client satisfaction.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
